# 10: a bounce from SET (a take), with its progress.
title A BOUNCE
about On SET, the BOUNCE row makes the song into a WAV file while you carry on. Each bounce is a fresh TAKE: chance and the dice roll again.
caption SET: BOUNCE
run --demo --view bounce-ready
from 0.5
length 18.0

0.7 say SET: BOUNCE.
2.0 say Left, right: what to bounce.
2.2 tap RIGHT 3 0.6
4.4 tap LEFT 3 0.3
5.4 say Each one is a new TAKE.
7.0 say A starts it.
7.4 tap A
8.6 say WORKING: how far it is.
12.2 say Done. Next: TAKE 2.
13.8 say Hold A, down: an earlier take.
13.8 hold A 2.4
14.4 tap DOWN
